{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o035a","title":"刘璋遣法正迎刘备","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o035a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘璋遣法正率四千人迎刘备，多次馈赠；法正向刘备提出取益州之策。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q"]},{"id":"pangfa-e-o012a-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"刘璋惧曹操将征张鲁，张松劝迎刘备，法正再奉命出使并阴献取益州之策。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o012a-q"]},{"id":"liuermu-a-03865960a68b524d17fe","label":"正文","text":"刘璋遣法正请刘备","evidence":["liuermu-q-0a038ffaa24576528bfd"]},{"id":"dongliu-a-9d022ce4dc7f5dbd3eff","label":"裴注·零陵先贤传","text":"刘璋遣法正迎刘备","evidence":["dongliu-q-11c6e4780ab69dc92401"]},{"id":"huangli-a-527ed25c64b325fa3dc3","label":"正文","text":"刘璋遣使迎刘备","evidence":["huangli-q-353bde86b9ef1d1be627"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0253","role":"遣使","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0046","role":"迎接献策","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"受策","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0045","role":"劝迎","evidence":["pangfa-e-o012a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"益州","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q"]},"time":{"year":211,"label":"建安十六年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y211","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o034","basis":"建安十六年"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o035a-q","xianzhu-q-o034","xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75"]},"source_order":[32,142,"O035a"],"order":6468}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0253","name":"刘璋","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0045","name":"张松","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0046","name":"法正","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongliu-q-11c6e4780ab69dc92401","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-2c4767765d1067e9bda7","layer":"pei","quote":"璋遣法正迎刘备","attribution":"裴注·零陵先贤传","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-2d8dc5ebd78dc53a5581","start":13,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-353bde86b9ef1d1be627","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-4bdc6c78c5ae5bde5231","layer":"original","quote":"璋不听，竟遣使迎先主","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":128,"end":138,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liuermu-q-0a038ffaa24576528bfd","section":"chapter-031","block":"b-bb8534db9135eea0c435","layer":"original","quote":"璋又从之，遣法正请先主","section_title":"刘二牧传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0068.xhtml","index":70,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-96d6db648b262b821258","layer":"original","quote":"后因璋闻曹公欲遣将征张鲁之有惧心也，松遂说璋宜迎先主，使之讨鲁。复令正衔命〖8〗，正既宣旨〖9〗，阴献策于先主曰：“以明将军之英才，乘刘牧之懦弱〖10〗；张松，州之股肱〖11〗，以响应于内。然后资益州之殷富〖12〗，凭天府之险阻；以此成业，犹反掌也。”","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o035a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-ae2a247007413ddbc8e1","layer":"original","quote":"璋然之，遣法正将四千人迎先主，前后赂遗以巨亿计〖12〗。正因陈益州可取之策。﹝四﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":141,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":41,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-09400c250015597cdc75","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-09400c250015597cdc75","layer":"modern","quote":"〖10〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211 ）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":152,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8471d798647e2ff3307a","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o034","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-464a6d3ab5db13314b70","layer":"original","quote":"十六年〖10〗，益州牧刘璋，遥闻曹公将遣钟繇等向汉中讨张鲁，内怀恐惧。别驾从事蜀郡张松说璋曰：“曹公兵强，无敌于天下；若因张鲁之资以取蜀土〖11〗，谁能御之者乎？”璋曰：“吾固忧之而未有计。”松曰：“刘豫州，使君之宗室，而曹公之深仇也，善用兵；若使之讨鲁，鲁必破；鲁破，则益州强；曹公虽来，无能为也。”","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":140,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
